This is a vendored copy of mozilla/rust-ece (https://github.com/mozilla/rust-ece),
version 2.4.2, with one change: the crate's default features no longer include
`backend-openssl`, so it builds without OpenSSL (Coocoo installs its own pure-Rust
`Cryptographer`, see crates/coocoo-core/src/ece_backend.rs).
